WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:05.268
This is Bots.

2
00:00:05.398 --> 00:00:08.634
Your bots answer people for you, all day long.

3
00:00:08.764 --> 00:00:10.490
Let's make a new one.

4
00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.166
Tap New bot.

5
00:00:12.466 --> 00:00:14.075
Pick "💬 Chat bot".

6
00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:17.580
It starts when someone opens your bot and taps Start.

7
00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:19.967
Then tap "Build it with Cas".

8
00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:23.359
Cas asks: what do you want your bot to do?

9
00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:26.661
Let's tap "✅ Make people join my channel first".

10
00:00:26.961 --> 00:00:29.056
Which channel should they join?

11
00:00:29.186 --> 00:00:30.646
Tap yours.

12
00:00:30.946 --> 00:00:33.841
Cas checks that your bot can see who joined.

13
00:00:33.971 --> 00:00:36.241
What do they get after they join?

14
00:00:36.371 --> 00:00:38.354
"🎁 A link to my free gift".

15
00:00:38.655 --> 00:00:40.675
Paste the link to your gift.

16
00:00:42.306 --> 00:00:46.385
Should Cas remind them after 10 minutes, if they haven't joined yet?

17
00:00:46.515 --> 00:00:47.985
"Yes please 👍".

18
00:00:48.285 --> 00:00:50.694
Your whole bot appears on the phone.

19
00:00:50.824 --> 00:00:54.508
First, a hello, with "📣 Open the channel" and "I've joined ✅".

20
00:00:54.638 --> 00:00:57.021
Then, once they join, your gift.

21
00:00:57.322 --> 00:00:58.601
Like it?

22
00:00:58.731 --> 00:01:00.575
Tap "Yes, perfect 👍".

23
00:01:00.874 --> 00:01:04.547
Now tap "▶ See it play", and pretend you are the new person.

24
00:01:04.677 --> 00:01:06.228
Tap "🙈 Not yet".

25
00:01:06.358 --> 00:01:09.551
Your bot kindly asks them to join first.

26
00:01:12.062 --> 00:01:13.949
Now tap "I've joined ✅".

27
00:01:14.079 --> 00:01:16.072
This time, they get the gift!

28
00:01:16.392 --> 00:01:17.617
Happy?

29
00:01:17.747 --> 00:01:19.426
Tap "🚀 Switch it on".

30
00:01:19.556 --> 00:01:21.341
Your bot is live!

31
00:01:21.642 --> 00:01:24.793
Tap "🛠 Open in builder", and "Copy the link".

32
00:01:24.923 --> 00:01:27.033
Put it in your ads and posts.

33
00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:36.372
Cas can build other bots too: a free gift, a menu, a bot that asks questions, or one that rewards people for inviting friends.

34
00:01:36.502 --> 00:01:38.330
Just tap, and answer.
